<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Westinghouse Electric Corp, raising the shares to its priority list from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 18-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
